ADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1416,"length":11,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1427,"length":20,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1447,"length":331,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"}],"backgroundColorStyle":"BACKGROUND_COLOR_STYLE_COLOR_SAMPLED","lightThemeColorPalette":{"baseBackground":4293983487,"raisedBackground":4293983487,"additiveBackground":556645089,"textPrimary":4278399037,"textSecondary":4279401110,"invertedBackground":4279401110,"overlayBackground":3422761021},"darkThemeColorPalette":{"baseBackground":4278261790,"raisedBackground":4278399037,"additiveBackground":724417249,"textPrimary":4292736765,"textSecondary":4287946996,"invertedBackground":4285715437,"overlayBackground":3422761021},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Complete Numpy Data Science Tutorial \nNumpy is a foundational library for anyone pursuing data science, machine learning or data analytics career. \nIn this tutorial, we cover everything from scratch - installing numpy, understanding key definitions, learning syntax and solving examples. \n\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n🚩Recommended Videos:\n✅Pandas Tutorial-    • Complete Python Pandas Data Science Tutorial  \n✅Complete Python Course-    • Python Tutorial for Beginners in Hindi | C...   \n✅Python Project for Data Analysis-    • Python Project for Data Analysis- Explorat...   \n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n\n👉 Subscribe for more data science and data analytics tutorial videos. \nKeep learning n keep growing 🚀  \n\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\nTimestamps: \n00:01:16  Install Python, Jupyter Notebook \u0026 Numpy \n00:06:16   Creating Arrays \n00:15:21 Array Attributes\n00:18:39   Initialization Methods\n00:28:00  Indexing \u0026 Slicing\n00:50:29  Reshaping \u0026 Flattening\n00:54:30  Stacking \u0026 Splitting \n00:59:26  Mathematical Operations on Array \n01:02:07  Mathematical Operations on Multiple Arrays \n01:06:41  Statistical Functions \n01:08:20  Array Comparison\n01:09:44  Broadcasting\n01:12:36  Handling Null Values  \n01:14:43  Save \u0026 Load Arrays\n\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n\n📌 Download Numpy Notes:  https://www.rishabhnmishra.com/notes \nor \nlink2:  https://colab.research.google.com/dri...\n\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n📣 Lets Connect\nInstagram:   / rishabhnmishra  \nLinkedIn:   / rishabhnmishra   \nTwitter:   / rishabhnmishra    \n\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRelevant keywords:\nnumpy python tutorial, Numpy for data science, numpy library in python, python, machine learning, data analytics, ai, numpy tutorial, full numpy course, data science tutorial, numpy for beginners, python numpy tutorial, python for data science, learn numpy, numpy python by rishabh mishra","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":344,"length":51,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCgQ040EGAciEwjvqPLQma6UAxXqL1UIHQW4JRrKAQSHgx_y","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=_BA5kFO7w44","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"_BA5kFO7w44","startTimeSeconds":0,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr3---sn-4g5ednkd.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026ofpcc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=fc10399053bbc38e\u0026ip=46.165.215.28\u0026initcwndbps=1107500\u0026mt=1778397886\u0026oweuc="}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"YouTube Channel Link: Complete Python Pandas Data Science Tutorial"}}},{"startIndex":421,"length":52,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCgQ040EGAciEwjvqPLQma6UAxXqL1UIHQW4JRrKAQSHgx_y","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=wloM0N_IMaw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"wloM0N_IMaw","startTimeSeconds":0,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieCo